WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:00.950
You wake up,

00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:01.870
look in the mirror,

00:00:02.290 --> 00:00:04.330
and there's a number floating above your head.

00:00:04.330 --> 00:00:07.480
Forty-one thousand, two hundred dollars.

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:09.410
Your exact income this year.

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.450
Every dollar, from every source.

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:13.170
You look out the window.

00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:15.010
Everyone has one.

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:16.530
For the next seven days,

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:18.870
you can see what every single person earns.

00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:20.590
And by day seven,

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:23.150
one of those numbers is going to ruin your life.
